    "blurb": "Integrate Valkey into your processes",
    "overview": "Connect Camunda processes with Valkey for caching, key-value storage, collections, counters, expiration, and Pub/Sub messaging. Connect to standalone and cluster deployments with authentication and SSL/TLS.",
    "rating": null,
    "reviewCount": 0,
    "mobileBundleId": null,
    "mobileAppStoreId": null
  },
  "overview": {
    "splashTitle": "Connect Camunda processes to Valkey",
    "splashDescription": "Processes often need fast access to temporary data such as cached lookups, counters, and shared state, and building custom integrations for that takes time. The Valkey Connector lets developers use Valkey-based caching, temporary data storage, counters, collections, and event-driven messaging directly in Camunda processes. It supports both standalone and cluster deployments, with authentication options including username, password, and SSL/TLS. It provides a wide range of Valkey operations for key-value storage, hashes, lists, sets, counters, key management, expiration, and Pub/Sub messaging, so teams can speed up processes and share data without writing custom integration code.",
    "imageUrl": "https://d3bql97l1ytoxn.cloudfront.net/app_resources/872566/overview/img9017735842634995980.png?95e2222eb7549bd23f244cd7e2c7566e",
